OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers will
OL,6,Fease this evening, though some may
OL,7,Flinger in the northwest into the early
OL,8,Fhours. Clearer skies will bring a
OL,9,Fchilly night, especially in rural
OL,10,Fareas.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA mostly dry day with sunny
OL,13,Fspells and patches of fair weather
OL,14,Fcloud, with the odd shower. After a
OL,15,Fcool start, temperatures will rise to
OL,16,Faround average in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
