OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry
OL,6,Fwith sunny spells on Sunday and
OL,7,FMonday, before showers and perhaps
OL,8,Fthunderstorms develop on Tuesday.
OL,9,FFeeling warmer, particularly in the
OL,10,Fsunshine.
